    "created_at": "2026-11-21T08:59:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T08:59:31Z",
    "body": "fix on issue/3102-heidenhain-q208 · PR #3118 · pinned by heidenhain_cycles peck_and_deep_have_distinct_documented_native_cycles_and_q_inventory (post), conformance drill_peck (app) · merges when reviewed\n\nThe post now writes `Q208=+99999.999` in the G205 block. The iTNC 530 cycle manual (670388-25, cycle 205) gives the range 0 to 99999.999 and writes `Q208=99999` in its own example. The new `drill_peck.nc` golden is on the branch: `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/heidenhain/drill_peck.nc`.\n\nPlease import that file on the iTNC 530 programming station again and tell us if the station reads the complete G205 block. The check on the Fehlmann (340490-03) is still open.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
