    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T09:26:55Z",
    "body": "The G205 import check passed on the iTNC 530 programming station with NC software `606425 004 SP20`.\n\nI imported the 17-line `drill_peck.nc` from PR #3118 at `2c9d79af073964cbed2f738518db181c0904f0a0` as `VMC_3-AXIS.I`. The station returned all 472 bytes unchanged. It read the complete `N100 G205` block, including `Q208=+99999.999 Q395=+0*`, with no error marker.\n\nIn the same session, the original #3095 file with `Q208=FMAX` again produced one `ERROR = N100 G205` block. The converters returned zero for both files. The error appeared in the original file’s readback.\n\nThis check covered import and readback only. The physical Fehlmann Picomax 55 check on `340490-03` remains open.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
